  "description": "The Sommet Carbon is a confidence inspiring 160mm enduro bike.\n\nThe Sommet handles technical downhills with ease, thanks to the modern aggressive geometry. Take your riding to the limits on your favourite trail or reach for the podium at your local enduro, the Sommet is with you all the way.\n\nThe Sommet CR geometry is backed up by a slick performing components package. Including 170mm RockShox Lyric Select Charger RC forks, 160mm Fox Float DPX2 Performance shock that pivots on a sealed upper bearing, SRAM NX/SX Eagle 1×12 gearing and SRAM Guide RE hydraulic disc brakes. Finished off with the high performance Maxxis 3C Tubeless ready tyres mounted on WTB ST Light i30 rims. No matter where you ride, the Sommet CR will never be out of its depth.\n\nModern carbon frame with boost spacing and aggressive geometry\n\nSRAM Guide RE Brakes with 200mm rotors\n\nSRAM 1x12 SX Eagle groupset\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMetric Trunnion mount shock with sealed bearing upper shock mount\n\nMaxxis 3c Tubeless ready tyres with tubeless rim tape fitted and valves included",
